1.0.5 (unreleased)
==================
- added use_admin config value: sites without the admin section, its tables and the error log; init asks for it
- init asks whether to use a database, and turns the database or the admin section on when run again
- renamed the rivena_migrations table to migrations, created with the first migration; sql/app.sql is sql/admin.sql
- added rivena.getCookie(), getTheme() and setTheme(); setCookie() saves objects and arrays as JSON, with secure
- added the .spinner class (a block spinning ring); the progress buttons use the same
- moved the dialogs' partials to partials/, for any layout; showNotification() adds #notifications itself
- added Controller.openDialog() and closeDialog() for a page's own dialog (Escape, focus, modal-visible)
- renamed assets/js/admin to assets/js/common
- removed the Http class: Http::wantsJson($request) is $request->wantsJson()

1.0.4 (2026-10-31)
==================
- added the content dialog: showDialog() shows a template of the page
- added width and height options to the dialogs; their contents scroll
- fixed the navbar's dropdowns showing above the dialogs

1.0.3 (2026-10-31)
==================
- added use_database config value: sites without a database
- minor css changes

1.0.2 (2026-10-29)
==================
- changed GeoIp db provider

1.0.1 (2026-10-28)
==================
- moved dist and package.json into assets, the npm package has its own readme

1.0.0 (2026-10-28)
==================
- initial release